    {
      "flavor_text": "むれを　つくらずに　１ぴきで　いる。\nじぶんが　いちばん　えらいと　どの\nポッタイシも　かんがえているようだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "무리를 만들지 않고 혼자 생활한다.\n어떤 팽태자라도 자신이 제일\n훌륭하다고 생각하는 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vit seul, à l’écart de ses pairs. Chaque individu est\nconvaincu d’être meilleur que les autres.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt allein, entfernt von anderen. Jedes von\nihnen denkt, es sei das Bedeutendste unter ihnen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive solo, alejado de los demás. Cada uno piensa que\nes el más importante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive da solo lontano dagli altri. Apparentemente\nogni esemplare crede di essere il più importante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives alone, away from others. Apparently, every\none of them believes it is the most important.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "群れを　作らずに　１匹で　いる。\n自分が　一番　偉いと　どの\nポッタイシも　考えているようだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
